<title>AUSTRIA: GE holds 5 pct of VA Tech - bourse.</title>
<headline>GE holds 5 pct of VA Tech - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Electric of the United States has acquired a stake of &quot;slightly more&quot; than five percent in Austrian engineering group VA Technologie AG, the Vienna bourse said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The shares are held by the group's pension funds, investment funds and GE's Paine Webber subsidiary.</p>
<p>VA Technologie is 24 percent owned by Austrian state holding company OeIAG, while steel maker VA Stahl holds 20.05 percent of the shares.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
